entries[275012] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Tokka's Multi-Ward", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to craft Tokka's Multi-Ward.\n\nA particularly useful totem that provides several useful boons when navigated treacherous waters.\n\nBoons Granted:\n\n- Blood Hunters will not attack you when catching them.\n\n- Water walking.\n\n- Detected Range reduced.\nRequires Midnight Fishing (1)\nRequires Venom Trawler or above with Captain Tokka's Crew.\nSell Price:\nTokka's Multi-Ward\n\nUse: Grants a boon of helpful fishing bonuses.\n\"When the right tools for the job are all of them.\"\nSell Price:\nRequires Blood Hunter (3), Dirty Darter (30), Sulfurous Sludgefish (6), Neutralized Venom Clot (2)" }
