entries[275018] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Coiled Stargorger Lure", ["text"] = "Binds to Warband\nUse: Teaches you how to craft a Coiled Stargorger Lure.\n\nFasten 5 starfish as bait in order to craft a Coiled Stargorger Lure .\n\nThe rarity of the starfish determines the amount of Lures crafted.\nRequires Midnight Fishing (1)\nRequires Cursed Angler or above with Captain Tokka's Crew.\nSell Price:" }
